      "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> Once per hour</p><div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Trigger</strong> You would gain a focus point if you critically succeeded on an Attack or skill check, but only succeed on the attempt, or you take damage less than a tenth of your maximum hit points.</p></div><hr><p>You exert yourself just enough that the volatile ether around you responds more readily, becoming available for you to use. You gain a focus point with your successful activity, as if you had critically succeeded it.</p></div>"
